:: Mom Gym Dinner Report 2 [event mom_quest] {"position":"4775,1075","size":"100,100"}
/* Quest "Was That Right?" (mom_gymDinner), part 2 of 2. Reached from her POV passage (Mom Gym Dinner POV, whose <<EndPov>>
   comes here through $povReturn). She has told me the evening; now she asks if it was right, and my answer holds every
   effect of the quest and the NextQuest. The branches follow $mom.flags.gymDinnerLetHim, like the POV. */
<<silent>><<SetBackground $locations[2].img>><</silent>>
<<if $mom.flags.gymDinnerLetHim === true>>
She tells me all of it, the ice baths and the wine and the bread basket, and his chair coming around the corner of the table after the second bottle. When she gets to his hand, she looks down at her knee as if it's still there and smooths the dress over it, slowly, twice.

<<silently>>
<<set _msgs = [
{ who: $mom, text: "I did what you said, honey, I let him. Within reason. He never went any higher than... well. It was within reason." },
]>>
<</silently>>
<<Chat _msgs>>

I listen to all of it and keep my face still. Something in my chest isn't still at all, and it isn't guilt. It's simpler and older than that: another man had his hand on something of mine for an hour and a half, and he only had it because I lent it to him. I tell myself it was an investment, which it was, and the contract is signed at full price.

I tell myself that twice.
<<else>>
She tells me about the ice baths, and the sauna you'll be able to book by the hour at the twelfth location, and the look on his face when she picked his hand up off her knee and put it back on the tablecloth like something he'd dropped. She laughs while she tells it, a real laugh, loose and happy, and then it fades, and she looks at me, and I can see her checking something.
<</if>>

<<silently>>
<<set _msgs = [
{ who: $mom, text: "So..." },
{ text: "She twists the strap of her purse around one finger." },
{ who: $mom, text: "Was that right? What I did?" },
]>>
<</silently>>
<<Chat _msgs>>

She isn't asking if the contract is good. She knows the contract is good. She's asking if she was good. She's sitting on the arm of the couch at eleven at night in a dress from twenty years ago, waiting for me to tell her.

<div id="gdr-choice" class="choices">
<div><<link "Tell her it was exactly right">><<replace "#gdr-choice">>
<<silently>>
<<set _msgs = [
{ who: $player, text: "It was exactly right. I don't think anybody else could have pulled that off." },
{ text: "It goes through her like warm water. Her shoulders come down from somewhere near her ears, and she closes her eyes for a second." },
{ who: $mom, text: "Oh, good. I wasn't sure, honey. I kept sitting there thinking, what would he want me to do, and then I just did that." },
{ who: $player, text: "That's all you ever have to do." },
]>>
<</silently>>
<<Chat _msgs>>

She picks up her heels and kisses the top of my head on her way past, and goes upstairs humming. Halfway up she stops and calls down, very softly, that she saved me some of the cheesecake, it's in her purse, in a napkin. It is.

<<UpdateStat "+" "MomCorruption" 4>>
<<UpdateStat "+" "MomRelation" 2>>
<<UpdateStat "-" "MomResistance" 3>>
<<Feel $mom "player" 2 "lasting">>
<<if $mom.flags.gymDinnerLetHim === true>><<Feel $mom "gymOwner" -1>><<else>><<Feel $mom "gymOwner" 1>><</if>>
<<ProfileLog $mom "Was That Right?" "She came home from the dinner with $gymOwner.name with the contract signed at full price. She told me everything and then asked me if what she did was right. I told her it was exactly right. That was all she needed.">>
<<NextQuest $mom>>
<<ReturnFromEvent "Continue" "Living Room">>
<</replace>><</link>></div>
<div><<link "Tell her next time she can do more">><<replace "#gdr-choice">>
<<silently>>
<<set _msgs = [
{ who: $player, text: "It was fine. Next time, though, you can do more." },
{ text: "She waits for the rest of the sentence, and there isn't any. Her finger stops twisting the strap." },
{ who: $mom, text: "More?" },
{ who: $player, text: "He signed tonight. The next one might not, unless somebody gives him a reason to." },
{ who: $mom, text: "Right. No, of course, you're right, honey. I just didn't... no, you're right." },
]>>
<</silently>>
<<Chat _msgs>>

She picks up her heels and goes upstairs without kissing the top of my head, and I hear the shower run for a long time. In the morning her eyes are a little puffy and she's extra cheerful at breakfast, and she asks me twice if my eggs are all right.

<<UpdateStat "+" "MomCorruption" 5>>
<<UpdateStat "+" "MomResistance" 2>>
<<UpdateStat "+" "MomExhibition" 1>>
<<Feel $mom "player" -2>>
<<if $mom.flags.gymDinnerLetHim === true>><<Feel $mom "gymOwner" -2 "lasting">><</if>>
<<UpdateStat "+" "Corruption" 2>>
<<ProfileLog $mom "Was That Right?" "She came home from the dinner with $gymOwner.name with the contract signed at full price, and asked me if what she did was right. I told her it was fine, and that next time she can do more. She went upstairs without saying goodnight.">>
<<NextQuest $mom>>
<<ReturnFromEvent "Continue" "Living Room">>
<</replace>><</link>></div>
</div>
